{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed solar tower, by reason of its combined height above local eaves level and bulk at around first floor level, would result in a highly prominent, overbearing and incongruous feature that would fail to integrate with host property and dominate the surrounding rear garden area, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of The London Plan (2021), Policy CS.1B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Plan Local Policies (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
